==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|XY Promo|Trevenant|14}}, one of the {{TCG|XY Black Star Promos}}.
*'''Wrack Down''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Platinum|Giratina|10}} from the {{TCG|Platinum}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

